From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:41:42 +0000
Subject: feat(demo): add rich text span background demos

Two demo pages exercising the per-span backgroundColor renderer fix
(feat_richtext_render_spanstyle_background_colors_on_all_platforms):
RichTextSpanBackgroundDemo (Compose, listed in ComposeAllSample) and
RichTextSpanBackgroundExamplePage (Kuikly DSL). Cases: single span, long
span wrapping over several lines, view background overlaid by span
backgrounds, adjacent spans of different sizes, span background with a
span colour, and a view-background-only control. Each case states the
expected rendering so Android, iOS and OHOS can be compared by eye. Mirrors
the demo added to upstream PR Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI#1774 on review request.

Fork-Patch: demo-richtext-span-background
Origin: Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI#1774
Upstream-Status: submitted Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI#1774
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

